{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09311","headline":"同德寺阁集眺 · 韦应物","name":"同德寺阁集眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳节欲云晏，游遨乐相从。\n高阁照丹霞，飀飀含远风。\n寂寥氛氲廓，超忽神虑空。\n旭日霁皇州，迢嶢见两宫。\n嵩少多秀色，羣山莫与崇。\n三川浩东注，瀍涧亦来同。\n阴阳降大和，宇宙得其中。\n舟车满川陆，四国靡不通。\n旧堵今即葺，庶甿亦已丰。\n周览思自奋，行当遇时邕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}